  m_Text: "<b>Don't Trust Your Luck!</b>\nA party board game made for Unity Game Jam 2026.\n\n<b>Design & development</b>\nandreary1\n\n<b>Built with</b>\nUnity 6 - Universal Render Pipeline\n\n<b>Art & audio</b>\nOriginal art and music made for this project.\nVisual inspiration: Fortaleza, Cear\xE1 (Brazil).\n\n<b>Thanks for playing!</b>"
